Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-25-2000||12:54 PM||||I struck gold with this one. I went to a bone yard to look for Fiero stuff. (Didnt find any) I opened the hatch of a 90ish Firebird and BAM!!! there it is ..A Fiero Holley Side Scoop. WOOO HOOO..... I took it to the check out and the guy asked me what it was. I told him it was a Fiero Body Scoop. He said give me $5.00....I was going to cry with joy...But the greed in me said no..I told him Ill give him $2.50 for it..He said OK!!!! P.S. Its in great shape. No cracks or chips.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Haze_sig_1.gif">  My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A>||||reg||14
